  {
    "id": "05ce5e42-2d2e-518d-8a9a-c93b2c06f6e3",
    "pack": "troubles-in-grayce",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:sweet-hags-eye",
    "name": "Sweet Hag's Eye",
    "level": 4,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["occult", "scrying"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "troubles-in-grayce",
        "page": 118,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4946"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This item appears to be a normal, if admittedly macabre, piece of hard peppermint candy the size and shape of a human eyeball. That's because it is actually the eye of a sweet hag, removed and painstakingly replaced with a mix of enchantment and cookery. It is typically mounted on a piece of jewelry or stored in a small sack worn on a cord."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The eye provides no direct benefit for the wearer, but the hag whose eye it once was can peer through it using the Seek action, and cast the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "c319a7b8-ee8e-5f50-97c7-16151916ad80"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " cantrip through it onto the creature carrying the eye. Both these effects have no range limited, provided the hag is on the same plane."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Any damage to the eye destroys it. The sweet hag can also choose to destroy the eye remotely using Meltaway Mint. The eye can also be eaten, but a creature who attempts this is exposed to sickeningly sweet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Meltaway Mint",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The hag causes the eye to melt away under a brief flare of intense heat. If a creature is holding the eye, they must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": 18
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save. On a failure, they take "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "1d4",
                "damageType": "fire",
                "category": "persistent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage as the boiling hot candy remains stick to and burn their skin."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sickeningly Sweet",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (ingested, poison) The sickened condition caused by this poison can't be ended until the poison's effects end"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saving Throw",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 20,
            "options": ["inflicts:sickened"]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Onset",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 1 minute"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Maximum Duration",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 10 minutes;"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stage 1",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
