  {
    "id": "b8dc8fc6-22b2-5fda-8f2d-b781b78f0e04",
    "pack": "troubles-in-grayce",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:vagabonds-teapot",
    "name": "Vagabond's Teapot",
    "level": 3,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "troubles-in-grayce",
        "page": 118,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4948"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These ceramic teapots are highly valued by travelers. While the teapot is filled with water, a creature can use a single action with the concentrate trait to instantly heat the water to boiling, at which point the kettle whistles and the water inside begins to cool at a normal rate. While the water remains heated, it is piping hot, and a creature splashed with it takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "1d4",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ],
            "label": "1d4 nonlethal fire damage"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Instead of filling the teapot with water, you can pour an elixir of 4th level or lower into the pot and use the following activation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
